WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:02.625
Three people. Three webinars.

00:02.625 --> 00:04.097
And the same problem.

00:05.347 --> 00:08.340
Two hundred people signed up for my Sunday class.

00:08.539 --> 00:10.843
Last time? Only sixty showed up.

00:11.692 --> 00:14.968
So Priya pasted her Zoom link into ShowUp AI.

00:15.167 --> 00:17.460
It planned eleven reminders for her.

00:17.460 --> 00:19.180
And wrote every single one,

00:19.180 --> 00:20.157
in her voice.

00:20.806 --> 00:22.438
Wait. It does WhatsApp too?

00:22.888 --> 00:23.751
It does.

00:24.902 --> 00:26.891
Honestly? Nothing goes out to my list

00:26.891 --> 00:28.439
unless I've seen it first.

00:29.089 --> 00:30.674
Nothing will. Review it,

00:30.674 --> 00:33.466
tap approve, and it sends right on time.

00:33.665 --> 00:35.989
The join link even lands one hour

00:35.989 --> 00:37.476
before you go live.

00:38.527 --> 00:40.865
Okay. So did people actually show up?

00:41.515 --> 00:42.424
Here's who came,

00:42.424 --> 00:43.653
channel by channel.

00:43.854 --> 00:47.087
And everyone who missed it gets their own follow-up.

00:47.737 --> 00:49.774
Huh. That's actually really nice.

00:51.023 --> 00:53.327
ShowUp AI. Keep your webinar tool.

00:53.327 --> 00:54.969
Fix your show-up rate.

00:55.168 --> 00:59.085
Try it free for fourteen days, at showupai.live.
